{"id":547,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"As long as this Pokémon bathes in sunlight, its cotton keeps growing. If too much cotton fluff builds up, Whimsicott tears it off and scatters it."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, it’ll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Whimsicott doesn’t live in a fixed location. It floats around on whirling winds, appearing all over the place to perform its mischief."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This nuisance sneaks into people’s homes, where it hides important things and scatters cotton all over the place."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon appears, riding upon the wind. But if the wind gusts up, it’ll blow the cotton on this Pokémon’s head clean off."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It rides on the wind and slips into people’s homes. After it has turned a room into a cotton- filled mess, it giggles to itself and takes off."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes."},{"games":["White"],"text":"Riding whirlwinds, they appear. These Pokémon sneak through gaps into houses and cause all sorts of mischief."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Prankster","hidden":false,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's status moves."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."},{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Grass","Fairy"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolu